        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phase is a hardcore precision platformer that will test your reflexes, patience, and precise control to the absolute limit. Trapped in a stark, minimalist world, your only goal is to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras/93f1bfef9bc21d7d39b3c451d063ae6b.avif?t=1773188146\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras_big/93f1bfef9bc21d7d39b3c451d063ae6b.webp?t=1773188146 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Only Way Out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exit of each stage is securely locked. To open the door, you must complete one of two conditions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>all the 'keys'</strong> hidden throughout the stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, find and destroy the <strong>'Core'</strong> that powers the stage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, this process won't be easy. You must achieve your goal while avoiding the numerous enemies and traps designed to block your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras/c5435c819646ec7effd5d0d9cf9440d5.avif?t=1773188146\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras_big/c5435c819646ec7effd5d0d9cf9440d5.webp?t=1773188146 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ability to Invert Reality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You possess unique abilities to navigate this monochrome world:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls:</strong> Move with the arrow keys and jump.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teleport:</strong> Press the spacebar to teleport your position and pass through deadly obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Inversion:</strong> While holding the spacebar, the world inverts from 'black' to 'white'.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 'inversion' state is crucial. <strong>Hidden enemies and key items (like keys) that are invisible in the normal black map will only reveal themselves in the inverted white world.</strong> You must use this ability strategically to find hidden paths and overcome challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras/3477e862980c6fa1c7562ab52b42bf72.avif?t=1773188146\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras_big/3477e862980c6fa1c7562ab52b42bf72.webp?t=1773188146 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>45 Meticulously Designed Stages:</strong> A total of 45 challenging, hand-crafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Difficulty:</strong> Start with simple obstacle avoidance and progress to extreme control challenges that require you to simultaneously handle complex enemy patterns, teleports, and map inversions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore Gameplay:</strong> There is no mercy. A single mistake means instant death and a quick restart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Art Style:</strong> A clean, black-and-white aesthetic that removes all distractions, allowing you to focus purely on the gameplay itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras/5817615c4467c54b26b12df852e71b36.avif?t=1773188146\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras_big/5817615c4467c54b26b12df852e71b36.webp?t=1773188146 width=1560 height=975 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras/d24ac07899f647e83e371f0b544b7ff8.avif?t=1773188146\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras_big/d24ac07899f647e83e371f0b544b7ff8.webp?t=1773188146 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phase is a hardcore precision platformer that will test your reflexes, patience, and precise control to the absolute limit. Trapped in a stark, minimalist world, your only goal is to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras/93f1bfef9bc21d7d39b3c451d063ae6b.avif?t=1773188146\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras_big/93f1bfef9bc21d7d39b3c451d063ae6b.webp?t=1773188146 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Only Way Out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exit of each stage is securely locked. To open the door, you must complete one of two conditions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>all the 'keys'</strong> hidden throughout the stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, find and destroy the <strong>'Core'</strong> that powers the stage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, this process won't be easy. You must achieve your goal while avoiding the numerous enemies and traps designed to block your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras/c5435c819646ec7effd5d0d9cf9440d5.avif?t=1773188146\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras_big/c5435c819646ec7effd5d0d9cf9440d5.webp?t=1773188146 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ability to Invert Reality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You possess unique abilities to navigate this monochrome world:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls:</strong> Move with the arrow keys and jump.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teleport:</strong> Press the spacebar to teleport your position and pass through deadly obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Inversion:</strong> While holding the spacebar, the world inverts from 'black' to 'white'.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 'inversion' state is crucial. <strong>Hidden enemies and key items (like keys) that are invisible in the normal black map will only reveal themselves in the inverted white world.</strong> You must use this ability strategically to find hidden paths and overcome challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras/3477e862980c6fa1c7562ab52b42bf72.avif?t=1773188146\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras_big/3477e862980c6fa1c7562ab52b42bf72.webp?t=1773188146 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>45 Meticulously Designed Stages:</strong> A total of 45 challenging, hand-crafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Difficulty:</strong> Start with simple obstacle avoidance and progress to extreme control challenges that require you to simultaneously handle complex enemy patterns, teleports, and map inversions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore Gameplay:</strong> There is no mercy. A single mistake means instant death and a quick restart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Art Style:</strong> A clean, black-and-white aesthetic that removes all distractions, allowing you to focus purely on the gameplay itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097670/extras/5817615c4467c54b26